  "body_html": "<div class=\"follower-sheet\" data-sheet=\"inventory\">\n<p>Sen <strong><em>Kuşan</em></strong> hamlesini yaptığında, aşağıdaki ◇'lardan bir kısmını belirli eşyalara ya da Belirsiz'e işaretle.</p>\n<ul class=\"bullets\">\n<li>Yükün <strong>hafif</strong> (<em>hızlı ve sessiz</em>) ise en fazla 3 ◇ işaretle</li>\n<li>Yükün <strong>normal</strong> ise 4-6 ◇ işaretle</li>\n<li>Yükün <strong>ağır</strong> (<em>gürültülü, yavaş, sıcak, çabuk yorar</em>) ise 7-9 ◇ işaretle</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"undefined\">Belirsiz</h3>\n<div class=\"fs-uses\"><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"inv-undef\"><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-0\" title=\"İşaret 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-0\" aria-label=\"İşaret 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-1\" title=\"İşaret 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-1\" aria-label=\"İşaret 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-2\" title=\"İşaret 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-2\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-2\" aria-label=\"İşaret 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-3\" title=\"İşaret 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-3\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-3\" aria-label=\"İşaret 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-4\" title=\"İşaret 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-4\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-4\" aria-label=\"İşaret 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-5\" title=\"İşaret 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-5\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-5\" aria-label=\"İşaret 6\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-6\" title=\"İşaret 7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-6\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-6\" aria-label=\"İşaret 7\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-7\" title=\"İşaret 8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-7\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-7\" aria-label=\"İşaret 8\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-8\" title=\"İşaret 9\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-8\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-8\" aria-label=\"İşaret 9\"></label></span></div></div>\n<p>Sen <strong><em>Gerekeni Bulundur</em></strong> hamlesini yaptığında, buradaki bir işareti aşağıdaki belirli bir ◇'ya taşı.</p>\n<h3 id=\"gear\">Teçhizat</h3>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-supplies-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-supplies-0\" aria-label=\"Yuva\"></span><label for=\"inv-supplies-0\"><span><strong>Malzeme</strong> (4+Refah kullanım ○○○○ ○○)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-more-supplies-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-more-supplies-0\" aria-label=\"Yuva\"></span><label for=\"inv-more-supplies-0\"><span><strong>Daha fazla malzeme</strong> (4+Refah kullanım ○○○○ ○○)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-even-more-supplies-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-even-more-supplies-0\" aria-label=\"Yuva\"></span><label for=\"inv-even-more-supplies-0\"><span><strong>Daha da fazla malzeme</strong> (4+Refah kullanım ○○○○ ○○)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"fs-muted\"><em>Malzemeyi Toparlan, Kamp Kur hamlelerinde ya da fazladan <em>küçük</em> eşya taşımak için kullan.</em></p>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-mess-kit-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-mess-kit-0\" aria-label=\"Yuva\"></span><label for=\"inv-mess-kit-0\"><span><strong>Yemek takımı</strong> (ateş ve su gerektirir; Malzemenin daha uzun süre yetmesini sağlar)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-bedroll-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-bedroll-0\" aria-label=\"Yuva\"></span><label for=\"inv-bedroll-0\"><span><strong>Şilte</strong> (Kamp Kurduğunda 1d6 fazladan HP geri kazan)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-blanket-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-blanket-0\" aria-label=\"Yuva\"></span><label for=\"inv-blanket-0\"><span><strong>Battaniye</strong> (<em>sıcak tutan</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-change-of-clothes-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-change-of-clothes-0\" aria-label=\"Yuva\"></span><label for=\"inv-change-of-clothes-0\"><span><strong>Yedek giysi</strong></span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-rope-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-rope-0\" aria-label=\"Yuva\"></span><label for=\"inv-rope-0\"><span><strong>Halat</strong>, ~7,5 m</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-shovel-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-shovel-0\" aria-label=\"Yuva\"></span><label for=\"inv-shovel-0\"><span><strong>Kürek</strong></span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-sledge-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-sledge-0\" aria-label=\"Yuva\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-sledge-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-sledge-1\" aria-label=\"Yuva\"></span><label for=\"inv-sledge-0\"><span><strong>Kızak/sedye/sürütme</strong>, rulo halinde</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-snow-shoes-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-snow-shoes-0\" aria-label=\"Yuva\"></span><label for=\"inv-snow-shoes-0\"><span><strong>Kar ayakkabıları</strong></span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-torch-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-torch-0\" aria-label=\"Yuva\"></span><label for=\"inv-torch-0\"><span><strong>Meşale</strong> (~1 saat dayanır; <em>erim</em>, <em>alan</em>, <em>tehlikeli</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-oil-lamp-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-oil-lamp-0\" aria-label=\"Yuva\"></span><label for=\"inv-oil-lamp-0\"><span><strong>Kandil</strong> (○○○ saat, <em>yakın</em>, <em>alan</em>, <em>kaba</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-extra-oil-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-extra-oil-0\" aria-label=\"Yuva\"></span><label for=\"inv-extra-oil-0\"><span><strong>Fazladan yağ</strong> (○○○○○ saat, kandil/fener için, silah olarak işe yaramaz)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-firewood-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-firewood-0\" aria-label=\"Yuva\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-firewood-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-firewood-1\" aria-label=\"Yuva\"></span><label for=\"inv-firewood-0\"><span><strong>Odun</strong> (tam bir geceye yeter, <em>erim</em>, <em>alan</em>)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-hatchet-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-hatchet-0\" aria-label=\"Yuva\"></span><label for=\"inv-hatchet-0\"><span><strong>El baltası</strong>, demir (<em>el</em>, <em>atılabilir</em>, x delici)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-mallet-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-mallet-0\" aria-label=\"Yuva\"></span><label for=\"inv-mallet-0\"><span><strong>Tokmak</strong>, demir ve/veya ahşap (<em>el</em>)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-mattock-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-mattock-0\" aria-label=\"Yuva\"></span><label for=\"inv-mattock-0\"><span><strong>Kazma</strong>, demir (<em>yakın</em>, x delici, <em>kanlı</em>, <em>hantal</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-maul-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-maul-0\" aria-label=\"Yuva\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-maul-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-maul-1\" aria-label=\"Yuva\"></span><label for=\"inv-maul-0\"><span><strong>Balyoz</strong>, demir (<em>yakın</em>, <em>savurucu</em>, <em>hantal</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-staff-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-staff-0\" aria-label=\"Yuva\"></span><label for=\"inv-staff-0\"><span><strong>Sopa</strong> (<em>yakın</em>)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-spear-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-spear-0\" aria-label=\"Yuva\"></span><label for=\"inv-spear-0\"><span><strong>Mızrak</strong>, demir (<em>yakın</em>, <em>atılabilir</em>, x delici)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-long-spear-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-long-spear-0\" aria-label=\"Yuva\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-long-spear-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-long-spear-1\" aria-label=\"Yuva\"></span><label for=\"inv-long-spear-0\"><span><strong>Uzun mızrak</strong>, demir (<em>erim</em>, x delici)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-bow-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-bow-0\" aria-label=\"Yuva\"></span><label for=\"inv-bow-0\"><span><strong>Yay ve demir oklar</strong> (<em>orta</em>, x delici, ○ ok azaldı, ○ ok bitti)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-extra-arrows-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-extra-arrows-0\" aria-label=\"Yuva\"></span><label for=\"inv-extra-arrows-0\"><span><strong>Yedek oklar</strong> (x delici, ○ bol ok var, ○ ok azaldı, ○ ok bitti)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-javelins-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-javelins-0\" aria-label=\"Yuva\"></span><label for=\"inv-javelins-0\"><span><strong>Ciritler</strong>, birkaç tane, demir (<em>atılabilir</em>, x delici, +1 hasar, ○ bitti)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-shield-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-shield-0\" aria-label=\"Yuva\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-shield-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-shield-1\" aria-label=\"Yuva\"></span><label for=\"inv-shield-0\"><span><strong>Kalkan</strong> (+1 zırh, Savun'da 7+ ile +1 Hazırlık)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-thick-hides-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-thick-hides-0\" aria-label=\"Yuva\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-thick-hides-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-thick-hides-1\" aria-label=\"Yuva\"></span><label for=\"inv-thick-hides-0\"><span><strong>Kalın postlar</strong> (1 zırh, <em>sıcak tutan</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-cloak-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-cloak-0\" aria-label=\"Yuva\"></span><label for=\"inv-cloak-0\"><span><strong>Pelerin</strong> (<em>sıcak tutan</em>)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"possessions-items-loot\">Eşyalar, nesneler, ganimet</h3>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot0-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot0-0\" aria-label=\"Yuva\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot0\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Eşya\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot1-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot1-0\" aria-label=\"Yuva\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot1\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Eşya\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot2-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot2-0\" aria-label=\"Yuva\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot2\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Eşya\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot3-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot3-0\" aria-label=\"Yuva\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot3\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Eşya\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot4-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot4-0\" aria-label=\"Yuva\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot4\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Eşya\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot5-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot5-0\" aria-label=\"Yuva\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot5\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Eşya\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot6-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot6-0\" aria-label=\"Yuva\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot6\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Eşya\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot7-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot7-0\" aria-label=\"Yuva\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot7\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Eşya\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"other-things\">Diğer şeyler</h3>\n<p class=\"fs-muted\">(hayvanlar, takımlar, bir yere bırakılmış eşyalar vb.)</p>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-notes\"><textarea class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:other-things\" rows=\"2\" aria-label=\"Diğer şeyler\"></textarea></div>\n<h3 id=\"small-items\">Küçük eşyalar</h3>\n<p>Cebe, keseye ya da çizme koncuna sığar. Sen <strong><em>Kuşan</em></strong> hamlesini yaptığında, aşağıdaki ☐ kutucuklarından 4+Refah kadarını işaretle.</p>\n<div class=\"fs-uses\"><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"inv-small-undef\"><span class=\"track-label\">Belirsiz</span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-0\" title=\"İşaret 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-0\" aria-label=\"İşaret 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-1\" title=\"İşaret 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-1\" aria-label=\"İşaret 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for